1.6 Registries named in "Identifier Sources"

  The list "Identifier Sources" only names external registries (Wikidata,
  GeoNames, VIAF, PeriodO, Biblissima, Mandragore, ARCA, Library of Congress
  authorities, BnF, ISNI, ORCID) and gives their home URL, so that a record can
  say which registry an identifier comes from. No registry data is copied.
  Short descriptions of ISNI, ORCID and the Library of Congress authority are
  the project's own wording.

